[{"answer":"Hello.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/1.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm Dawn Matthews.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, hello.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I've been referred to you because I'm enquiring about the refresher courses that you run.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd like to find out a bit more about them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we run quite a few different short courses for students who are either returning to study or studying part-time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Um, tell me about your situation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I think that I really need some help in preparing for the coming semester,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/9.mp3"},{"answer":"especially to build up my confidence a bit","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/10.mp3"},{"answer":"and help me study effectively because, you see,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/11.mp3"},{"answer":"I've been out in the work-force for nearly twelve years now, so...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/12.mp3"},{"answer":"it really is a long time since I was last a student.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it can seem like a long time, can't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Um, well, let me start by telling you what courses we have that might suit you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Are you an undergraduate or a postgraduate?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Arts or Sciences?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Undergraduate, and I'm in the Business faculty.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Right then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/19.mp3"},{"answer":"First of all, there's our intensive 'Study for Success' seminar","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/20.mp3"},{"answer":"on the first and second of February.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/21.mp3"},{"answer":"It's aimed at students like you who are uncertain about what to expect at college,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/22.mp3"},{"answer":"and looks at a fairly wide range of approaches to university learning,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/23.mp3"},{"answer":"to motivate you to begin your study","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/24.mp3"},{"answer":"and build on your own learning strategies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Mm, that sounds good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/26.mp3"},{"answer":"What are some of the strategies that are presented?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we try to cover all aspects of study.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Some of the strategies in writing, for example,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/29.mp3"},{"answer":"would be improving your planning for writing,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/30.mp3"},{"answer":"organising your thinking","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/31.mp3"},{"answer":"and building some techniques to help you write more clearly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/32.mp3"},{"answer":"With reading, there'll be sessions aimed at getting into the habit of analysing material as you read it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/33.mp3"},{"answer":"and tips to help you record and remember what you have read.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/34.mp3"},{"answer":"It really is very important to begin reading confidently right from the beginning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/35.mp3"},{"answer":"There's also advice on how to get the most from your lectures","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/36.mp3"},{"answer":"and practice in giving confident presentations,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/37.mp3"},{"answer":"as well as how to prepare for exams.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/38.mp3"},{"answer":"What about the motivational side of things?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah. Well, there's a range of motivational exercises that we do","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/40.mp3"},{"answer":"to help the students feel positive and enthusiastic about their study.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/41.mp3"},{"answer":"The process of learning and exploring a subject can lead to a whole new way of looking at the world,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/42.mp3"},{"answer":"and the study skills and techniques that you build up","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/43.mp3"},{"answer":"can be applied in all sorts of different ways.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Actually, I...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/45.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm very excited about the whole thing of taking up studying again but,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/46.mp3"},{"answer":"you know, I'm a little nervous about whether I'll manage to get everything done.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/47.mp3"},{"answer":"I suppose it's the same for all mature students?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course it is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Two of the key components of the course are time management","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/50.mp3"},{"answer":"and overcoming procrastination.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/51.mp3"},{"answer":"People discover that, once they learn to plan their days,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/52.mp3"},{"answer":"all the work can be accomplished and there'll still be time for leisure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Is there an enrolment fee?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, er, oh, just a minute, let's see...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah, the cost is 30 pounds,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/56.mp3"},{"answer":"which includes all course materials and morning tea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/57.mp3"},{"answer":"You have to arrange your own lunch.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/58.mp3"},{"answer":"That wouldn't be a problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/59.mp3"},{"answer":"I already make sandwiches for my three kids and my wife and myself every day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/60.mp3"},{"answer":"I won't have to change my routine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, I need to tell you that this is a very popular course","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/62.mp3"},{"answer":"and it's essential that you book well ahead of time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/63.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact, the Course Convenor tells me that there are only five places left.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/64.mp3"},{"answer":"What other course might be good for me?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/65.mp3"},{"answer":"There is one other that you could benefit from.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/66.mp3"},{"answer":"It's simply called 'Learning Skills for University Study'","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/67.mp3"},{"answer":"and is on three consecutive mornings","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/68.mp3"},{"answer":"starting on a Monday, from nine to twelve,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/69.mp3"},{"answer":"and costs 25 pounds.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/70.mp3"},{"answer":"This is aimed at upgrading the study skills most school-leavers have","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/71.mp3"},{"answer":"and help them cope with the increased demands of university study.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/72.mp3"},{"answer":"It focuses mainly on making students more responsible for their own success.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/73.mp3"},{"answer":"What sort of things are covered in this course?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, basically it's more advanced thinking,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/75.mp3"},{"answer":"note-taking, reading and writing strategies,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/76.mp3"},{"answer":"but also some input about stress management.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/77.mp3"},{"answer":"I think I'd be better off starting from the basics and looking at all the strategies, don't you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, from what you've told me, I think that's more in line with your situation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/79.mp3"},{"answer":"Alright then,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/80-2023-09-06-16-39-30.mp3"},{"answer":"can I book a place on the 'Study for Success' seminar course now?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Let me just get out a registration form and take down your details.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-3-part-3-2023-08-12-20-23-09/83.mp3"}]
